msgid ""
"Large main building with street access for passenger stations. Provides "
"capacity for 100 passengers."
msgstr "大型主建筑，带通往客运站的街道出入口。可容纳 100 名乘客。"

msgid ""
"Large main building with street access for passenger stations. Provides "
"capacity for 150 passengers."
